      "html": "† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">גָּאָה</span></big></big>  <strong>verbo. elevar-se (</strong>aramaico Peal (𝔗 <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.5\">1Sm 2.5</a>) e frequentemente etiópico <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶתְגָּאֵי</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܶܬܓܰܠܻܝ</span> <em>ser jactancioso, orgulhoso</em>, cf. também hebraico pós-bíblico<strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:1\" href=\"/Exodus.15.1\">Êx 15.1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:21\" href=\"/Exodus.15.21\">Êx 15.21</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּאוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.5\">Ez 47.5</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְאֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 8:11\" href=\"/Job.8.11\">Jó 8.11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 10:16\" href=\"/Job.10.16\">Jó 10.16</a>, infinitivo absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּאֹה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:1\" href=\"/Exodus.15.1\">Êx 15.1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:21\" href=\"/Exodus.15.21\">Êx 15.21</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>elevar-se</em>, das águas <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.5\">Ez 47.5</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>crescer</em>, de plantas <a data-ref=\"Job 8:11\" href=\"/Job.8.11\">Jó 8.11</a>. <strong>3.</strong>  <em>ser elevado, exaltado</em>, da cabeça <a data-ref=\"Job 10:16\" href=\"/Job.10.16\">Jó 10.16</a>, de <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> em triunfo <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:1\" href=\"/Exodus.15.1\">Êx 15.1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:21\" href=\"/Exodus.15.21\">Êx 15.21</a>.",
