      "preview": "גַּאֲוָה: substantivo feminino: majestade, orgulho, elevação.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גַּאֲוָה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino. majestade, orgulho (</strong>cf. siríaco <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܰܐܝܽܘܬܳܐ</span> <strong>)</strong>—<a data-ref=\"Job 41:7\" href=\"/Job.41.7\">Jó 41.7</a> + 6 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּאֲוַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.23\">Pv 29.23</a> + 2 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּאֲוָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.3\">Is 13.3</a> + 8 vezes;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>elevação, avolumamento</em> do mar <a data-ref=\"Psalms 46:4\" href=\"/Psalms.46.4\">Sl 46.4</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>majestade</em>, de Israel <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:29\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.29\">Dt 33.29</a>, de Moabe <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.6\">Is 16.6</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:29\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.29\">Jr 48.29</a>, das escamas do crocodilo <a data-ref=\"Job 41:7\" href=\"/Job.41.7\">Jó 41.7</a>, de Deus <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.26\">Dt 33.26</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:35\" href=\"/Psalms.68.35\">Sl 68.35</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>orgulho, altivez</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:2\" href=\"/Psalms.10.2\">Sl 10.2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:19\" href=\"/Psalms.31.19\">Sl 31.19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:24\" href=\"/Psalms.31.24\">Sl 31.24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 36:12\" href=\"/Psalms.36.12\">Sl 36.12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:6\" href=\"/Psalms.73.6\">Sl 73.6</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.3\">Pv 14.3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.23\">Pv 29.23</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.8\">Is 9.8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.11\">Is 13.11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.11\">Is 25.11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עליזי גאותי</span> <em>os meus que exultam orgulhosamente</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.3\">Is 13.3</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:11\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.11\">Sf 3.11</a>.",
