      "preview": "גָּבַהּ: verbo: ser alto, elevado, exaltado; Qal e Hifil.",
      "html": "<big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">גָּבַהּ</span></big></big>  <strong>verbo. ser alto, exaltado (</strong>hebraico pós-bíblico <em>idem</em> (Hifil), aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבַהּ</span>, cf. árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">جَبْهَةٌ</span> <em>testa</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">جَبَةٌ</span> <em>proeminência da testa;</em> compare-se talvez também assírio <em>gabâni</em>, <em>alturas</em> (?) Lotz<sup>TP 133</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.16\">2Cr 26.16</a> + 5 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּֽבְהָא֯</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.5\">Ez 31.5</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">א</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">ה</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּבַהְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.10\">Ez 31.10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּֽבְהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 35:5\" href=\"/Job.35.5\">Jó 35.5</a> + 3 vezes; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְבַּהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.12\">Pv 18.12</a> + 5 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְבְּהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.14\">Ez 31.14</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְבָּ֑הוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 36:7\" href=\"/Job.36.7\">Jó 36.7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּגְבָּ֑הוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.15\">Jr 13.15</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּגְבְּהֶינָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:50\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.50\">Ez 16.50</a>; infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּגְבֹהַּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:11\" href=\"/Psalms.103.11\">Sl 103.11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְגָבְהָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:11\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.11\">Sf 3.11</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>ser alto, elevado, de grande altura</em>, por exemplo árvore <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.11\">Ez 19.11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.5\">Ez 31.5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.10\">Ez 31.10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.14\">Ez 31.14</a>, céus <a data-ref=\"Job 35:5\" href=\"/Job.35.5\">Jó 35.5</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 55:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.55.9\">Is 55.9</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:11\" href=\"/Psalms.103.11\">Sl 103.11</a>, homem <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:23\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.23\">1Sm 10.23</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>ser exaltado</em>, do homem em dignidade e honra <a data-ref=\"Job 36:7\" href=\"/Job.36.7\">Jó 36.7</a>, do servo de Yahweh <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 52:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.52.13\">Is 52.13</a>, de Deus <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.16\">Is 5.16</a>, dos caminhos de Deus <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 55:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.55.9\">Is 55.9</a>. <strong>3.</strong>  <em>elevado</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּבַהּ לִבּוֹ</span>:— <strong>a.</strong>  em bom sentido, <em>encorajado</em> nos caminhos de Yahweh <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 17:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.17.6\">2Cr 17.6</a>; <strong>b.</strong>  nas demais passagens em mau sentido, <em>ser altivo</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 131:1\" href=\"/Psalms.131.1\">Sl 131.1</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.12\">Pv 18.12</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.16\">2Cr 26.16</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.25\">2Cr 32.25</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 28:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.28.2\">Ez 28.2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 28:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.28.5\">Ez 28.5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 28:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.28.17\">Ez 28.17</a>, e assim sem <span dir=\"rtl\">לב</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.16\">Is 3.16</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.15\">Jr 13.15</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:50\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.50\">Ez 16.50</a> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:11\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.11\">Sf 3.11</a>.<br><strong>Hifil</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">הִגְבַּהְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.24\">Ez 17.24</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יַגְבִּיהַּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:27\" href=\"/Job.39.27\">Jó 39.27</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.16\">Jr 49.16</a> <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:4\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.4\">Ob 1.4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּגְבִּיהֶהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 33:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.33.14\">2Cr 33.14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יַגְבִּיהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 5:7\" href=\"/Job.5.7\">Jó 5.7</a>; infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגְבֵּהַּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.11\">Is 7.11</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:31\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.31\">Ez 21.31</a>; particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">מַגְבִּיהַּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.19\">Pv 17.19</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 113:5\" href=\"/Psalms.113.5\">Sl 113.5</a>;—<em>tornar alto, exaltar</em>, por exemplo árvores <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.24\">Ez 17.24</a>, muro <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 33:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.33.14\">2Cr 33.14</a>, porta <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.19\">Pv 17.19</a>, ninho <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.16\">Jr 49.16</a> <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:4\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.4\">Ob 1.4</a>, habitação <a data-ref=\"Psalms 113:5\" href=\"/Psalms.113.5\">Sl 113.5</a>, um pedido <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.11\">Is 7.11</a>, os humildes <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:31\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.31\">Ez 21.31</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יַגְבִּיהוּ עוּף</span> <em>elevar seu voo, voar alto</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 5:7\" href=\"/Job.5.7\">Jó 5.7</a>, sem <span dir=\"rtl\">עוף</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:27\" href=\"/Job.39.27\">Jó 39.27</a>.",
