      "preview": "גָּבֹהַּ: adjetivo: alto, exaltado, altivo; substantivo: altura.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גָּבֹהַּ</span></big>  <strong>adjetivo. alto, exaltado</strong>—<a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.2\">1Sm 9.2</a> + 15 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּבוֹהַּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 138:6\" href=\"/Psalms.138.6\">Sl 138.6</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבֹהַּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 16:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.16.7\">1Sm 16.7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבַהּ</span> (Ew<sup>§ 213 d</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 101:5\" href=\"/Psalms.101.5\">Sl 101.5</a> + 3 vezes; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבֹהִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 5:7\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.5.7\">Ec 5.7</a> + 5 vezes; feminino <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבֹהָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.5\">Dt 3.5</a> + 6 vezes; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבֹהוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:3\" href=\"/Daniel.8.3\">Dn 8.3</a> + 2 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבֹהֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:52\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.52\">Dt 28.52</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>alto, elevado, de grande altura</em>, por exemplo <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.24\">Ez 17.24</a>, torre <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 2:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.2.15\">Is 2.15</a> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:16\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.16\">Sf 1.16</a>, monte <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:19\" href=\"/Genesis.7.19\">Gn 7.19</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:18\" href=\"/Psalms.104.18\">Sl 104.18</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.9\">Is 40.9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.7\">Is 57.7</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.22\">Ez 17.22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.2\">Ez 40.2</a>; cf. expressões <span dir=\"rtl\">על כל גבעה גבהה</span> <em>sobre todo outeiro alto</em> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:23\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.23\">1Rs 14.23</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 17:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.17.10\">2Rs 17.10</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.20\">Jr 2.20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">על גבעות הגבהות</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.2\">Jr 17.2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל־כָּל־הַר גָּבֹהַּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.25\">Is 30.25</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.6\">Jr 3.6</a>; homem <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.2\">1Sm 9.2</a>; árvore <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבַהּ קוֹמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.3\">Ez 31.3</a>; chifres <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:3\" href=\"/Daniel.8.3\">Dn 8.3</a>; muros <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.5\">Dt 3.5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:52\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.52\">Dt 28.52</a>; forca <a data-ref=\"Esther 5:14\" href=\"/Esther.5.14\">Et 5.14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 7:9\" href=\"/Esther.7.9\">Et 7.9</a>; porta <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:58\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.58\">Jr 51.58</a>; altar <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.22\">Ez 41.22</a>; coisas altas <a data-ref=\"Job 41:26\" href=\"/Job.41.26\">Jó 41.26</a> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 12:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.12.5\">Ec 12.5</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>exaltado em posição</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:31\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.31\">Ez 21.31</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּי גָּבֹהַּ מֵעַל גָּבֹהַּ שֹׁמֵר וּגְבֹהִים עֲלֵיהֶם</span> <em>pois um elevado acima de outro elevado vigia, e o Altíssimo está sobre eles</em> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 5:7\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.5.7\">Ec 5.7</a> assim Ew Zö e outros, mas Vrss De Now e outros, potentados (terrenos) <em>mais elevados sobre eles</em>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>altivo</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 138:6\" href=\"/Psalms.138.6\">Sl 138.6</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.15\">Is 5.15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:33\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.33\">Is 10.33</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.3\">1Sm 2.3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבַהּ־עֵינַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 101:5\" href=\"/Psalms.101.5\">Sl 101.5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳ לֵב</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.5\">Pv 16.5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳ רוּחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:8\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.8\">Ec 7.8</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  <strong>substantivo.</strong>[<strong>masculino.</strong>] <em>altura</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבֹהַּ קוֹמָתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 16:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.16.7\">1Sm 16.7</a>; cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, גָּדוֹל\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_גָּדוֹל\">גָּדוֹל</a> <strong>10</strong>, p. 153.",
