      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּ֫בַהּ</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino. altura</strong>—<a data-ref=\"Job 22:12\" href=\"/Job.22.12\">Jó 22.12</a> + 9 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּבְהוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.4\">1Sm 17.4</a> + 5 vezes; plural construto <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּבְהֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 11:8\" href=\"/Job.11.8\">Jó 11.8</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>altura</em>, de edificações e árvores <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.18\">Ez 1.18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.11\">Ez 19.11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.10\">Ez 31.10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.14\">Ez 31.14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:42\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.42\">Ez 40.42</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.8\">Ez 41.8</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 3:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.3.4\">2Cr 3.4</a> <a data-ref=\"Amos 2:9\" href=\"/Amos.2.9\">Am 2.9</a>; provavelmente também <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.13\">Ez 43.13</a> (do altar), assim 𝔊 Ew Co em lugar do TM <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּב</span> (veja-se esse verbete); do homem <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.4\">1Sm 17.4</a>; do céu <a data-ref=\"Job 11:8\" href=\"/Job.11.8\">Jó 11.8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 22:12\" href=\"/Job.22.12\">Jó 22.12</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">גבה</span> construto SI<sup>6</sup> de rocha).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>exaltação, grandeza</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 40:10\" href=\"/Job.40.10\">Jó 40.10</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>altivez</em>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:29\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.29\">Jr 48.29</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גּ׳ אַף</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:4\" href=\"/Psalms.10.4\">Sl 10.4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גּ׳־לִבּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:26\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.26\">2Cr 32.26</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גּ׳ רוּחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.18\">Pv 16.18</a>.",
